          "supplement-07f4c918a00c8919"
        ],
        "section": "Article 50 review - company operating facts",
        "text": "Context revision: RC-CONTEXT-2026-09-12-R1\nBusiness observation date: 26 August 2026. Authoring clarification date: 12 September 2026. These case dates are separate from the date a learner retrieves the sources.\nPrepared by Operations with the named system owners for the current review. These are authored facts for the fictional Quillhaven training case, not statements about a real company or a Legal decision. This context supplements the unchanged AI-POL-2026-08-15 policy and the dated system, evidence and action registers. It does not revise their recorded notices, evidence states, proposed dates or approvals.",
