      },
      {
        "id": "passage-supplement-744e2c04498c2a36",
        "summary": "Product timing and evidence limits",
        "evidence_ids": [
          "supplement-744e2c04498c2a36"
        ],
        "section": "Product timing and evidence limits",
        "text": "The suppliers' product-release notices held by Operations report that the currently licensed image-generation product used for AI-003 and audio/video-generation product used for AI-008 were first offered commercially in the EU on 1 June 2026. These are product market-entry dates, not the dates Quillhaven exported or published individual images or videos. They do not identify Quillhaven as the supplier. Current release and market-entry evidence for AI-005 remains unavailable.\nThis document records owner-supplied operating facts. It does not replace missing screenshots, prove provenance metadata survived publication, refresh stale evidence, authorize an exception or settle statutory applicability. No Legal approval, expiry date, activated policy or new operational deadline is supplied. Legal reviews the learner's supported interpretation; system owners resolve the specifically identified factual gaps.",
